## Why This Is Asked
Tests understanding of private AWS data access patterns, policy composition, and practical testing. 

## Key Concepts
- S3 public access blocking and bucket policy conditions
- VPC Endpoints and endpoint policies
- aws:SourceVpce condition and VPCE validation
- IAM roles for data producers

